ompositing and nearest blocks pass.','historical_comparison':{'earlier_failure':'1262x904 observed viewport versus 1280x1000 screenshot; eight bounds failures and supplemental +9 x diagnostic retained','new_result':'1280x1000 observed viewport/screenshot; exact recorded-bound pixel matches without coordinate offsets','preservation':preservation['unchanged']},'style_decision':'Preserve FAMILY-RESULT.json style_decision unchanged','remaining':['Working four 16x16 horizontal frames, 100ms/frame, actual timed activity and loop-boundary review','Retry at assets/error-retry.png and Paused at assets/paused.png under own distinct meanings','All-member color/non-color distinction, full continuity and collective destination acceptance','Review retained requirement/production-selection drift before future production; never rebind old jobs or transfer verdicts'],'limits':['No provider generation or new artwork','No all-member family acceptance','No claim of live PixelLab quality or another engine acceptance']}
(out/'comparison.json').write_text(json.dumps(c,indent=2)+'\n',encoding='utf-8')
print(json.dumps({'saved':str(out),'historical_files':len(now),'preserved':preservation['unchanged']}))
